After some time, the train started climbing the ghats.
The scenery outside changed completely.
The train was moving very slowly now.
I looked out from my own window.
There were big mountains and deep valleys everywhere.
But those mountains were not green.
It was the time of intense summer.
Therefore, the valleys were looking very dry and brown.
The hillsides were very rocky.
The sunshine outside was very fierce.
A woman sitting opposite closed her window.
But I kept my own window open.
I liked looking at those dry valleys.
That scenery was very different and beautiful.
I took out my phone.
And I took some photos of the rocky hills.
In a short while, the train reached the top of the ghat.
